                                                "sense_id": "c6c0f9ad-e872-3c1e-bc1e-814d0c1fc41b",
                                                "text": "Between 2006 and 2007, the number of vishing identity theft cases rose from 3 percent of theft to 40 percent (Source: Javelin Strategy & Research.)"
